<title>USA: Waigel--Forex levels reflect economic fundamentals.</title>
<headline>Waigel--Forex levels reflect economic fundamentals.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said Monday that exchange rates are in line with current economic fundamentals.</p>
<p>In a speech to the Interim Committee of the International Monetary Fund, Waigel said, &quot;Exchange rates are again in line with fundamental economic data and various economic situations.&quot;</p>
<p>Waigel added that past major misalignments of currency rates have been corrected.</p>
</text>
